  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Cut capsicum into small chunks. Cut zucchini into thin rounds.\n• Drain kidney beans.\n• Finely chop garlic. Roughly chop spinach.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62ec6ec5cde4996def02b5a3/step-aec61d9f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large saucepan over medium-high heat. Cook capsicum and zucchini until softened, 2-3 mins. Stir in garlic, kidney beans, tomato paste and jerk seasoning. Cook for 1-2 mins.\n• Add coconut milk, water and vegetable stock. Bring to a boil then reduce heat to medium-low. Simmer until thickened, 4-6 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62ec6ec5cde4996def02b5a3/step-985cad5b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in spinach and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62ec6ec5cde4996def02b5a3/step-11277568.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the jerk-spiced bean stew between bowls. Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62ec6ec5cde4996def02b5a3/step-39eaa73a.jpg"
    }
  ]
